    "Queue is empty" : {
      "comment" : "Shown centered in the lower half of the large Home Screen widget, in the area that normally lists the Up Next episodes, when something is playing but nothing follows it. 'Queue' is the ordered list of episodes to play (the list the app calls Up Next). One short line in a fixed-height area — a long translation will not fit.",
